  "skill_title": "Genome Annotation Pipeline (Eukaryotic)",
  "skill_description": "End-to-end eukaryotic genome annotation (nuclear genomes of fungi, plants, and animals; organelle genomes are out of scope — see mitotree-agent): soft-mask repeats, predict protein-coding genes (BRAKER3/GALBA/Funannotate), annotate ncRNAs, assign functional labels, and QC the result. Routes through a decision tree to select the optimal tool per evidence type and clade; ships a Nextflow DSL2 runner (runners/nextflow-runner/) for reproducible unattended execution."
